<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
  <PropertyGroup>
    <TargetFrameworks>net10.0;net8.0;netstandard2.1;netstandard2.0;</TargetFrameworks>
    <RootNamespace>LiteOrm.Common</RootNamespace>
    <AssemblyVersion>8.1.0.0</AssemblyVersion>
    <FileVersion>8.1.0.0</FileVersion>
    <GeneratePackageOnBuild>True</GeneratePackageOnBuild>
    <GenerateDocumentationFile>True</GenerateDocumentationFile>
    <VersionPrefix>8.1.0</VersionPrefix>
    <Nullable>enable</Nullable>
    <Title>LiteOrm.Common</Title>
    <Authors>danjiewu</Authors>
    <PackageProjectUrl>https://danjiewu.github.io/LiteOrm</PackageProjectUrl>
    <PackageReadmeFile>README.nuget.md</PackageReadmeFile>
    <PackageTags>orm;sql;oracle;mysql;sql server;sqlite</PackageTags>
    <Description>LiteOrm.Common 公共库：LiteOrm 的共享核心，提供表达式树（Expr）、SQL 片段、表元数据（TableInfoProvider）、特性与公共接口，由 LiteOrm 包自动引用。</Description>
    <PackageReleaseNotes>
8.1.0 Breaking Changes:
- PreparedSql 移至 LiteOrm.Common 项目，参数类型由 KeyValuePair 改为自定义 Param；
- AttributeTableInfoProvider 不再依赖 SqlBuilderFactory、DataSourceProvider。

8.1.0 New Features:
- 新增 AOT / NativeAOT 支持：ExprJsonConverter、LambdaExprConverter 改为 AOT 安全实现，新增源生成的 ExprJsonSerializerContext；
- ColumnDefinition.DbType 可为空，运行时自动判定 DbType 类型；
- 目标依赖包版本降低，减少版本冲突。
    </PackageReleaseNotes>
    <RepositoryUrl>https://github.com/danjiewu/LiteOrm.git</RepositoryUrl>
    <PackageLicenseExpression>MIT</PackageLicenseExpression>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <PropertyGroup>
    <LangVersion>14.0</LangVersion>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(TargetFramework)' == 'net8.0' OR '$(TargetFramework)' == 'net10.0'">
    <IsAotCompatible>true</IsAotCompatible>
    <SuppressTrimAnalysisWarnings>true</SuppressTrimAnalysisWarnings>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)|$(TargetFramework)|$(Platform)'=='Release|netstandard2.0|AnyCPU'">
    <DocumentationFile>bin\Release\LiteOrm.Common.xml</DocumentationFile>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <PropertyGroup Condition="'$(Configuration)|$(TargetFramework)|$(Platform)'=='Debug|netstandard2.0|AnyCPU'">
    <DocumentationFile>bin\Debug\LiteOrm.Common.xml</DocumentationFile>
    <OutputPath />
  </PropertyGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <Compile Remove="DAO\**" />
    <EmbeddedResource Remove="DAO\**" />
    <None Remove="DAO\**" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <None Include="..\README.nuget.md">
      <Pack>True</Pack>
      <PackagePath>\</PackagePath>
    </None>
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup Condition="'$(TargetFramework)' == 'net10.0'">
    <PackageReference Include="System.Text.Json" Version="10.0.0" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup Condition="'$(TargetFramework)' == 'net8.0'">
    <PackageReference Include="System.Text.Json" Version="8.0.0" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup Condition="'$(TargetFramework)' == 'netstandard2.1' OR '$(TargetFramework)' == 'netstandard2.0'">
    <PackageReference Include="System.Text.Json" Version="8.0.0" />
  </ItemGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <ProjectReference Include="..\LiteOrm.Generators\LiteOrm.Generators.csproj" OutputItemType="Analyzer" ReferenceOutputAssembly="false" />
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>